{"a":[139,139],"h":"<p>139.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"95\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 95.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 35.3 35.3 35.3 35.3 43.4 43.4 43.4 61.4 61.4 72.0 72.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.7 61.4 78.7\" y=\"25.4 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> O putlara tapanlar yokmu? Hiç şüphe yok<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"139\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 139.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 30.0 30.0 45.8 45.8 54.8 54.8 72.8 79.6 95.3 95.3 102.8 102.8 109.6 116.3 116.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"79.6 102.8 109.6 123.0\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bunların içinde bulundukları: Din diye içine düştükleri şey, parçalanıb yıkılmağa mahkûm<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"204\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 203.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.0 51.0 51.0 57.7 73.4 80.3 88.4 88.4 95.3 102.0 122.3 129.0 144.7 144.7 155.3 155.3 165.7 172.4 179.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 42.0 57.7 102.0 129.0 172.4 179.3 187.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve ıbadet diye yaptıkları bütün batıldır, hiçtir. -Maksadları Allaha takarrub bile olsa yine hiçtir, küfürdür. 140. </p>"}